# BuildKit reads this for packages/mz-monitoring-benchmark/Dockerfile, whose
# context is the repository root. Cargo needs every workspace member's manifest
# and sources to resolve the workspace, and nothing else.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!packages/dashboards/
!packages/mz-monitoring-benchmark/
!packages/mz-monitoring-build/
!packages/mz-monitoring-check/
!packages/mz-monitoring-e2e/
!packages/mzmon-lib/
**/target/
